0030:       marker with the marker color.
0031:     - For each tall region, replace the full region-width row through every
0032:       marker with the marker color.
0033:     - Preserve colored regions that contain no marker.
0034: 
0035:     Key insight
0036:     - The marker does not spread globally; the aspect ratio of its own rectangle
0037:       chooses the perpendicular divider direction and the rectangle bounds stop it.
